00:10:07,058 --> 00:10:13,058
The Abandoned is a thriller, horror, mystery film directed by Eytan Rockaway.

3
00:15:10,588 --> 00:15:16,588
A troubled young woman who, in a last-ditch effort at getting her life together, takes a job
working nights as a security guard at an abandoned luxury apartment building.

4
00:20:14,117 --> 00:20:20,117
Stuck with a brusque rent-a-cop as her partner, she tries to not let her
mind play tricks on her while she patrols the empty halls.

5
00:25:17,647 --> 00:25:23,647
But as the night progresses strange things begin to happen -
and she realizes it may not all be in her head.

6
