11
00:55:38,823 --> 00:55:44,823
The Abandoned (also known as The Confines, and Confined) is a 2015 American
supernatural horror film directed by Eytan Rockaway, and written by Ido Fluk.

12
01:00:42,352 --> 01:00:48,352
It stars Jason Patric, Louisa Krause and Mark Margolis.

13
01:05:45,882 --> 01:05:51,882
The film premiered at the Los Angeles Film Festival on June 14, 2015, and was
released in theaters and video on demand on January 8, 2016 by IFC Films.

14
01:10:49,411 --> 01:10:55,411
The film concerns a struggling young woman, who tries to reacquire her normal life by
taking a job as a security guard at an abandoned apartment building.

15
01:15:52,941 --> 01:15:58,941
The Abandoned marked Rockaway's debut as director.

16
01:20:56,470 --> 01:21:02,470
The tone is mind_bending and dark and intense.
